While using the app along with the short notes and Apple Pencil, the iPad starts to heat up if used continuously for 15 minutes. Also short notes tend to register pencil response with a lag once the note becomes lengthy. 
  There is something wrong with the app as I have already gotten my iPad exchanged for a new one due to this issue.
@apple please fix the issue as there is no other use of your device, for me.
